001000**************************************************************
001100**                                                          **
001200**   T Z B L R P T - MEMO Z-BILL POs REPORT                 **
001300**                                                          **
001400**                                                          **
001500**   MEMO Z-BILL POs ARE POs CONTAINING ITEMS WHICH ARE     **
001600**   COMPANY PROPERTY THAT ARE SENT OFF PLANT SITE FOR      **
001700**   REPAIR, RETOOLING, ASSEMBLY, ETC.  TO DENOTE THE PO IS **
001800**   MEMO Z-BILL PO AN 'M' SUFFIX MUST BE USED ON THE       **
001900**   PURCHASE ORDER NUMBER.  WHEN THIS   IS DONE THE PO     **
002000**   CREATE PROGRAM WILL ASK FOR A ESTIMATED UNIT VALUE FOR **
002100**   THE ITEM SO THAT THE TOTAL VALUE OF ALL ITEMS OFF      **
002200**   PLANT SITE CAN BE DETERMINED BY RUNNING THIS REPORT.   **
002300**   WHEN THE PO IS CREATED THIS DENOTE THE ITEM(S) ARE     **
002400**   OFF PLANT SITE AND WHEN THE RECEIVING SLIP IS CREATED  **
002500**   THE ITEM(S) ARE CONSIDERED BACK ON PLANT SITE.         **
002600**   REMEMBER THIS REPORT WILL ONLY INCLUDE POs WITH AN 'M' **
002700**   SUFFIX ON THE PURCHASE ORDER NUMBER.                   **
002800**   THERE ARE 2 REPORT OPTIONS WHEN RUNNING THIS REPORT.   **
002900**     1) MONTH END SUMMARY REPORT (CONSISTS OF 3 REPORTS)  **
003000**        a) Z-BILL POs OPENED DURING A GIVEN MONTH         **
003100**        b) Z-BILL POs RECEIVED DURING A GIVEN MONTH       **
003200**        c) Z-BILL POs NOT CLOSED AS OF A GIVEN MONTH      **
003300**     2) ALL OPEN Z-BILL POs OLDER THAN A GIVEN MONTH      **
003400**                                                          **
003500**                                                          **
003600**     XRSCREEN REPORT NO. - 15                             **
003700**     REPORT HEADER       - DHDR87.PUB                     **
003800**     FORM NAME IN FRSCREEN - ZBLRPT                       **
003900**     AR12 ON THE ACCOUNTS PAYABLE REPORT MENU (UDCAP.PUB) **
004000**                                                          **
