034000 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING HD-ROUTE-DATA REPORT-OPTIONS.
034100 MAIN SECTION.
034200 00-START.
034300     PERFORM  1-HSK  THRU  1-HSK-X.
034400     PERFORM  6-MAIN  THRU  6-MAIN-X.
034500     PERFORM  2-CLOSE-FILES  THRU  2-CLOSE-FILES-X.
034600
034700     GOBACK.
034800
034900 1-HSK.
9406CK     MOVE "C" TO SCOPE.
9406CK     CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING SCOPE.

035000     CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
035100     MOVE CHAR-1636PI             TO  COMPRESS-PRINT.
035200     MOVE CHAR-10PI               TO  NORMAL-PRINT.
035300     MOVE TEXT-LENGTH-61          TO  ESC-TEXT-61.
035400     MOVE TEXT-LENGTH-60          TO  ESC-TEXT-60.
036000
           OPEN INPUT DVENDOR DPORECD DPOITEM DRCVITEM MPORCV.
036100     MOVE 1                       TO  DATE-MODE.
036200     CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
036300     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT          TO  PRT-DATE.
036400     MOVE DATE-FORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO  PRT-TIME.
036500
036600 1-HSK-X.
036700     EXIT.
036800
036900 2-CLOSE-FILES.
           CLOSE DVENDOR DPORECD DPOITEM DRCVITEM MPORCV.
037500
037600 2-CLOSE-FILES-X.
037700     EXIT.
037800
