038000**                                                  **
038100**   BLOWUP ROUTINE                                 **
038200**                                                  **
038300******************************************************
038400
038500 2-BLOWUP.
038600     MOVE "TZBLRPT"               TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
038700     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
038800         DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
038900             BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
039000
039100 3-READ.
039200     READ WORK-FILE AT END
039300         MOVE "1" TO XFILE-STATUS.
039400
039500
039600 4-PRINT-RECORD.
039700     IF LINE-CTR > 55
039800         PERFORM 4-PRINT-HEADER-LINES.
039900     WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM PRT-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
040000     ADD 1 TO LINE-CTR.
040100
040200 4-PRINT-HEADER-LINES.
040300     ADD 1                        TO PAGE-CTR.
040400     MOVE 8                       TO LINE-CTR.
040500     MOVE PAGE-CTR                TO PAGE-NO.
040600     WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM HEADER-1 AFTER
040700         ADVANCING NEW-PAGE.
040800     MOVE SPACES                  TO PRINT-RECORD.
040900     WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM FFORMAT AFTER
041000          ADVANCING 2.
041100     MOVE SPACES                  TO PRINT-RECORD.
041200     WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM HEADER-2 AFTER
041300          ADVANCING 1.
041400     MOVE SPACES                  TO PRINT-RECORD.
041500     WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM HEADER-3 AFTER
041600          ADVANCING 1.
041700     MOVE SPACES                  TO PRINT-RECORD.
041800     WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM HEADER-4 AFTER
041900          ADVANCING 1.
042000     MOVE SPACES                  TO PRINT-RECORD.
042100     WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM FFORMAT AFTER
042200          ADVANCING 1.
042300     MOVE SPACES                  TO PRINT-RECORD.
042400     WRITE PRINT-RECORD AFTER ADVANCING 1.
042500
042600**********************************************
042700**                                          **
042800**     MAIN  SECTION                        **
042900**                                          **
043000**********************************************
043100
043200 6-MAIN.
043300     PERFORM 60-ACCEPT-OPTIONS  THRU  60-ACCEPT-OPTIONS-X.
           MOVE SPACES TO CCRTFILE-PARMS.
           MOVE "DZBLRPT"          TO CCRTFILE-FILE.
      *    MOVE "QTEMP"            TO CCRTFILE-LIBRARY.
           MOVE "0030"             TO CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH.
           CALL "CCRTFILE" USING    CCRTFILE-LIBRARY
                                    CCRTFILE-FILE
                                    CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH
                                    CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS
                                    CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT
                                    CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS
                                    CCRTFILE-STATUS.
           IF CCRTFILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "CCRTFILE CREATE DZBLRPT FAILED" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
036700        PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
043400
043500     OPEN OUTPUT WORK-FILE.

           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE SPACES TO PORCVNO   OF DPORECD-REC.
           START DPORECD KEY >= PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
043600     PERFORM 61-GET-ZBILL-ORDER  THRU  61-GZO-X.
043700     CLOSE WORK-FILE.
043800
043900     SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY S-PO
044000                                     S-RLS-NO
044100         USING WORK-FILE
044200         GIVING WORK-FILE.
044300
044400     PERFORM 62-PRINT-REPORTS  THRU  62-PR-X.
044500
044600 6-MAIN-X.
044700     EXIT.
044800
044900 60-ACCEPT-OPTIONS.
045200
045300****************************************************
045400**   PRESENTLY THERE ARE 2 OPTIONS
045500**    1) A MONTH-END CLOSING REPORT FOR Z-BILLS
045600**    2) Z-BILL OLDER THAN A CERTAIN DATE.
045700****************************************************
045800
046000     IF END-MONTH NOT = SPACES THEN
046100** USER WANTS MONTH-END REPORT
046200         MOVE END-MONTH  TO  LAST-MONTH, FIRST-MONTH, P-MONTH
046300         MOVE END-YEAR   TO  LAST-YEAR, FIRST-YEAR, P-YEAR
046400     ELSE
046500** USER WANTS ITEMS OLDER THAN DATE
046600         MOVE "00" TO LAST-DAY
046700         MOVE RPT-MONTH  TO  LAST-MONTH, P-MONTH
046800         MOVE RPT-YEAR   TO  LAST-YEAR, P-YEAR.

      *--------- ACCOUNT FOR CENTURY.
           IF FIRST-YEAR > SPACES
               IF FIRST-YEAR > "70"
                   MOVE "19"      TO  FIRST-CC
               ELSE
                   MOVE "20"      TO  FIRST-CC.

           IF LAST-YEAR > SPACES
               IF LAST-YEAR > "70"
