067700 631-GET-ITEMS.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC.
           START DPOITEM KEY = PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
