072300     IF FILE-END
072400         GO TO 64-WRB-X.
072500     MOVE SPACE                   TO  PRINT-STATUS.
072600     MOVE SPACE                   TO  PO-TOO-OLD-SW.
072700     MOVE ZERO                    TO  PO-TOTAL-VALUE.
072800     MOVE W-PO                    TO  PO-NO.
072900     MOVE W-RLS-NO                TO  PO-RLSE.
073000     MOVE "000"                   TO  PO-RS.
073100     MOVE "P"                     TO  PO-PREFIX.
073200**MPORCV CONTAINS THE NUMBER OF RECEIVING SLIPS FOR EACH P.O.
073300**WE WILL CHECK EACH RELEASE TO DETERMINE ITS ACTIVITY FOR
073400**THIS MONTH
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PORCVNO OF MPORCV-REC.
           READ MPORCV INTO BUF-MPORCV
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
073700     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
073800         MOVE "GET MPORCV *64-WRB" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
073900         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
074000
074100     IF (M-PO-BLK-INDIC = "B" OR SPACE) OR
074200        (M-PO-LAST-RCVR = ZEROS)
074300         GO TO 64-WRITE-REPORT-B
074400     ELSE
074500         MOVE PO-ARG              TO  RS-ARG
074600         MOVE M-PO-LAST-RCVR      TO  RS-RCVR
074700         MOVE ZEROS               TO  SAVE-RCVR
074800         MOVE "N"                 TO  PO-ITEMS-LOADED-SW.
074900
075000 64-FIND-RCVRS.
075100****************************************************************
075200**  FIND LAST RCVR. LAST-RCVR IS KNOCKED ONE EACH TIME THRU THE
075300**  LOOP.  IF PRESENT RCVR IS TOO OLD THEN ALL REMAINING WILL
075400**  BE TOO OLD. SO THERE IS NO NEED TO LOOK FURTHER
075500****************************************************************
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE RS-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DRCVITEM-REC.
           START DRCVITEM KEY = PORCVNO OF DRCVITEM-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
075800     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
075900         IF COND-WORD = 17
076000             GO TO 64-CHECK-RCV-NO
076100         ELSE
076200             MOVE "FIND DRCVITEM *64-FR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE RS-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
076300             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
076400
076500 64-GET-RCVRS.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DRCVITEM NEXT INTO BUF-DRCVITEM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PORCVNO OF DRCVITEM-REC NOT = RS-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
076800     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
076900         IF COND-WORD = 15
077000             GO TO 64-CHECK-RCV-NO
077100         ELSE
077200             MOVE "GET DRCVITEM *64-GR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
077300             GO TO 2-BLOWUP
077400     ELSE
077500         IF RCV-DATE-RCVD-CN < FIRST-DATE-CN THEN
077600** TOO OLD EXIT LOOP
077700             MOVE "1" TO PO-TOO-OLD-SW
077800         ELSE
077900             IF RCV-DATE-RCVD-CN > LAST-DATE-CN THEN
078000** TOO NEW GET NEXT RCVR
078100                 NEXT SENTENCE
078200             ELSE
078300                 PERFORM 641-PRINT-RCV-ITEM  THRU  641-PRI-X
078400                 GO TO 64-GET-RCVRS.
078500
078600 64-CHECK-RCV-NO.
078700     IF TOO-OLD
078800         NEXT SENTENCE
078900     ELSE
079000         SUBTRACT 1               FROM RS-RCVR
079100         IF RS-RCVR = ZEROS
079200             NEXT SENTENCE
079300         ELSE
079400             GO TO 64-FIND-RCVRS.
079500
079600     IF PRINTED-ITEM
079700         MOVE SPACES              TO  PRT-LINE
079800         MOVE PO-TOTAL-VALUE      TO  P-TOTAL
079900         MOVE "                       P.O. TOTAL ="
