081300     ELSE
081400         PERFORM 6411-LOAD-PO-ITEMS THRU 6411-LPI-X.
081500
081600     IF NOT PRINTED-ITEM
081700**P.O. HAS NOT YET BEEN PRINTED
081800         MOVE SPACE               TO  PRT-LINE
